# Azure-Native RAG Boilerplate

Production-ready FastAPI and Azure Functions boilerplate for an Azure-native
retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system.

## Features

- FastAPI backend with upload, processing, and RAG query APIs
- Azure Blob Storage for document ingestion
- Azure Functions blob trigger for automatic processing
- Azure OpenAI for embeddings and chat completion
- Azure AI Search for vector search and metadata indexing
- Azure Translator integration for multilingual indexing and retrieval
- PostgreSQL for users, roles, and audit logs
- Azure Entra ID bearer-token authentication with issuer and audience validation
- Azure Key Vault secret resolution through `DefaultAzureCredential`
- Structured logging with request correlation IDs

